1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,910
In 2009, some young scientists

2
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:05,140
called fifteen detox brands.

3
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:06,380
Two questions.

4
00:00:06,410 --> 00:00:07,510
What does detox mean?

5
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:08,800
And where's the proof?

6
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:10,940
No two brands meant the same thing.

7
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:12,110
Most had no proof.

8
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:13,580
Oh, and one of them?

9
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:15,580
It was a hair straightener.

10
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:17,040
Detox teas are no different.

11
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:19,010
Often, it's senna. A laxative.

12
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,540
You lose water, not toxins.

13
00:00:20,570 --> 00:00:22,060
The real detox?

14
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:23,330
Your liver and kidneys.

15
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:25,700
No straightener required.
